WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:01.400 --> 00:00:02.701
-Hey, everyone.
Every week, we like to bring you

00:00:02.701 --> 00:00:04.801
some uplifting creative videos
from around the country.

00:00:04.801 --> 00:00:06.200
We usually
do this on Wednesdays,

00:00:06.200 --> 00:00:07.868
but we're changing
things up this week.

00:00:07.868 --> 00:00:09.033
It's time for,

00:00:09.033 --> 00:00:12.334
"What Are You Doing Wednesday:
Friday Edition."

00:00:12.334 --> 00:00:13.801
-♪ What are you doing?
It's Wednesday ♪

00:00:13.801 --> 00:00:15.000
-♪ Or Friday ♪

00:00:15.000 --> 00:00:16.434
-♪ What are you doing
on Wednesday? ♪

00:00:16.434 --> 00:00:18.033
-♪ I said Friday ♪

00:00:18.033 --> 00:00:23.334
[ Laughter ]

00:00:23.334 --> 00:00:25.400
-Did you write that
five minutes ago?

00:00:25.400 --> 00:00:29.000
-[ High-pitched ] Yeah. I did.
[ Laughter ]

00:00:29.000 --> 00:00:35.334
-Insane!
-"Insane!"

00:00:35.334 --> 00:00:38.467
First up, this pet owner taught
their dog an amazing new trick.

00:00:38.467 --> 00:00:39.300
Check this out.

00:00:39.300 --> 00:00:40.300
♪♪

00:00:40.300 --> 00:00:41.601
-Piece.

00:00:41.601 --> 00:00:43.767
Good.
Up top.

00:00:43.767 --> 00:00:46.968
Yes!
Good job.

00:00:46.968 --> 00:00:49.634
Okay.

00:00:49.634 --> 00:00:51.968
Good.
Up top.

00:00:51.968 --> 00:00:53.567
Yes, good job.

00:00:53.567 --> 00:00:54.734
-Dude, come on.

00:00:54.734 --> 00:00:58.534
That dog plays Jenga
better than I do.

00:00:58.534 --> 00:01:02.434
Next, these kids
got into a bit of trouble.

00:01:02.434 --> 00:01:05.801
♪♪

00:01:05.801 --> 00:01:07.868
-Oh, my God.

00:01:07.868 --> 00:01:11.100
[ Laughter ]

00:01:11.100 --> 00:01:14.300
Luna.
Really?

00:01:16.334 --> 00:01:17.767
[ Laughter ]

00:01:17.767 --> 00:01:19.167
-I love "Reallys."

00:01:19.167 --> 00:01:21.133
"Really?"
"Really."

00:01:21.133 --> 00:01:24.901
[ Laughter ]

00:01:24.901 --> 00:01:26.834
Can't argue with
that confidence, man.

00:01:26.834 --> 00:01:28.067
Here's another one.

00:01:28.067 --> 00:01:30.501
This woman had a fun surprise
for her family.

00:01:30.501 --> 00:01:31.901
She got them together
for a group photo,

00:01:31.901 --> 00:01:33.567
but, well, you watch.

00:01:33.567 --> 00:01:36.334
-Ready?
Say cheese.

00:01:36.334 --> 00:01:37.467
-Cheese.
-Cheese.

00:01:37.467 --> 00:01:39.234
-Oh, that didn't come out good.
Hold on.

00:01:39.234 --> 00:01:41.767
Say "Mia's pregnant."

00:01:41.767 --> 00:01:43.400
-What?!
-No.

00:01:43.400 --> 00:01:45.601
No, you're not.
-Don't do that.

00:01:45.601 --> 00:01:47.534
-That's mean.
-[ Laughs ]

00:01:47.534 --> 00:01:50.434
-I did say it.
-Don't do that.

00:01:50.434 --> 00:01:52.834
-What? Are you?
-Really?

00:01:52.834 --> 00:01:54.667
-[Bleep]
-Can you please say it?

00:01:54.667 --> 00:01:55.834
-Hold on.
Let's take it.

00:01:55.834 --> 00:01:57.067
I want to get a picture
of everybody.

00:01:57.067 --> 00:01:59.567
-Oh, yeah!
Just -- Are you serious?

00:01:59.567 --> 00:02:03.300
-Ready? Say...
-Aaaaah!

00:02:03.300 --> 00:02:05.367
-..."It's twins."
-No, it's not.

00:02:05.367 --> 00:02:06.734
-No, it's not.
[ Laughter ]

00:02:06.734 --> 00:02:09.567
-No, it's [bleep] not.
-It's [bleep] twins?

00:02:09.567 --> 00:02:11.834
Are you [bleep] kidding me?
It's twins?

00:02:11.834 --> 00:02:13.467
It's [bleep] twins?
[ Camera shutter clicks ]

00:02:13.467 --> 00:02:16.601
[ Laughter ]

00:02:16.601 --> 00:02:19.434
-Got the photo.
Got the photo.

00:02:19.434 --> 00:02:22.000
That's classic right there.

00:02:22.000 --> 00:02:24.167
And, finally, I've always wanted
to Roller Blade.

00:02:24.167 --> 00:02:27.133
You ever Roller Blade, Tariq?
-Uh, no.

00:02:27.133 --> 00:02:29.067
[ Laughter ]
Nope.

00:02:29.067 --> 00:02:30.868
-I could see you
rockin' Roller Blades.

00:02:30.868 --> 00:02:35.234
-Well, the closest I've come to
Roller-Blading was ice-skating.

00:02:35.234 --> 00:02:36.534
-Yeah.
-And, uh...

00:02:36.534 --> 00:02:40.000
I'm never gonna do that again.
[ Laughter ]

00:02:40.000 --> 00:02:41.434
Nope.
-I think it would be cool, man.

00:02:41.434 --> 00:02:43.767
I just don't know how to stop.

00:02:43.767 --> 00:02:45.701
I figured it'd look cool,
I'd get the look down.

00:02:45.701 --> 00:02:47.100
-Well, yeah.
The look is --

00:02:47.100 --> 00:02:49.634
That's half the battle,
but stopping is the other half.

00:02:49.634 --> 00:02:52.334
-L.A. Looks.
Yeah.

00:02:52.334 --> 00:02:54.200
I'll, like, Roller Blade
to a museum

00:02:54.200 --> 00:02:55.734
or something cool like that.
Something like that.

00:02:55.734 --> 00:02:57.868
-Yeah.
Headband, fanny pack.

00:02:57.868 --> 00:03:00.501
-Yeah, maybe
feather in the headband.

00:03:00.501 --> 00:03:02.367
-Yeah, a little feather
in the band.

00:03:02.367 --> 00:03:04.868
-Maybe BluBlockers.
-Of course.

00:03:04.868 --> 00:03:06.200
Got to get BluBlockers.

00:03:06.200 --> 00:03:08.601
-Maybe the headset
that's also an AM/FM radio.

00:03:08.601 --> 00:03:10.100
-Dope, yes.
That's it.

00:03:10.100 --> 00:03:12.667
-And then,
maybe a snake around my neck.

00:03:12.667 --> 00:03:14.968
-Oh, man, that's the look, yeah.

00:03:14.968 --> 00:03:16.701
-Anyways, I just don't know
how to stop,

00:03:16.701 --> 00:03:18.934
and, well, she doesn't, either.
Watch.

00:03:18.934 --> 00:03:21.133
-Help me!
I can't stop! I can't stop!

00:03:21.133 --> 00:03:24.200
-Oh!

00:03:24.200 --> 00:03:25.334
[ Laughter ]

00:03:25.334 --> 00:03:26.634
[ Cymbals crash ]

00:03:26.634 --> 00:03:28.300
-[ Laughs ]

00:03:28.300 --> 00:03:29.567
-"Hey, I'm good!
I'm good!"

00:03:29.567 --> 00:03:30.968
There you go, everybody.

00:03:30.968 --> 00:03:33.801
That is "What Are You Doing
Wednesday: Friday Edition."

